==English==

===Etymology===
The verb is from {{etyl|non|en}} {{term|skvala||to cry out|lang=non}}. The noun is probably from the verb.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɔːl}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[squall line]], multicell line, or part of a squall line.
# A sudden [[storm]], as found in a squall line. Often a nautical usage.

